  "description": "A loveless marriage, a respectful husband, and a peaceful life. For Anais, that was enough to bury the painful scars of her past.\n\nUntil her childhood first love, Siasen, walks back into her life wearing a new name and a promise that his feelings have never changed.\n\nAs Siasen’s return shatters the calm of her arranged marriage, Anais realizes her \"gentle\" husband, Garcia, has been hiding a much darker, possessive side behind his polite smile.\n\n*\"Where are you returning from in such a hurry, my wife?\"*\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/6417000001)     \nR15: [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/6417000002)",
